      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just so scary because it's so subtle. it's like they know exactly how to push my buttons without leaving a paper trail of actual harassment. like, they can just say \"oh, the payroll system was just glitchy\" or \"the cafeteria menu changed due to a vendor issue.\" if i try to bring it up to HR, they'll probably just tell me i'm being paranoid and use that against me. i feel like i'm being gaslit by the entire administration. how do i prove the *intent* behind these things when they're disguised as accidents?",
